This repository — including the demo page, its source files, the reference
recordings and the generated audio clips — is published during anonymous peer
review of the accompanying submission. It is made publicly readable only so
that reviewers can open a single link and listen to the samples.

Permission is granted to reviewers to access, download and listen to the
material for the purpose of evaluating the submission. Any other use,
reproduction, redistribution, publication or inclusion in another dataset is
not permitted without written permission from the authors.

The reference recordings are excerpts from a dialect speech corpus used for
evaluation and are included only to make the demo self-contained for review;
their inclusion in a publicly readable page is limited to the review period.
